@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1
# Valid Institute Token
@token = 44|Rzgzu2bIysXXOIoyHKCYK4foZox3baBTqcXJK9s01f691275
@studentId = 35

### Get All Fees (Filtered by date)
GET {{baseUrl}}/institute/fees?date=2026-04-28
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Student Fees
GET {{baseUrl}}/institute/fees/{{studentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Create New Fee Record (with Date and Enum payment_method)
POST {{baseUrl}}/institute/fees
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "student_id": {{studentId}},
    "total_amount": 2000,
    "paid_amount": 2000,
    "date": "2026-04-28",
    "payment_method": "Online",
    "status": "Paid"
}

###

### Export Fee Report PDF
GET {{baseUrl}}/institute/fees/export?date=2026-04-28
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/pdf

###

### 1. Razorpay Create Order (Android App Flow)
POST {{baseUrl}}/institute/subscription/create-order
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "plan_id": 2
}

###

### 2. Razorpay Verify Payment (Android App Flow)
# Replace placeholders with values returned from Razorpay in Step 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/institute/subscription/verify-payment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "plan_id": 2,
    "razorpay_order_id": "order_placeholder",
    "razorpay_payment_id": "pay_placeholder",
    "razorpay_signature": "signature_placeholder"
}
